title: Start
---
Once upon a time, in a land far far away...
An online dispute on WhotsOpp sparked anger between two individuals.
A question as old as time...
"Which came first? The chicken or the egg?"
They agreed to resolve this quarrel in a calm and peaceful manner.
A duel to the death between the WhotsOpp Chicken and the WhotsOpp Egg
will [i]surely[/i] determine the fate of Beak versus Shell.
===
